{"strongs": "H3235", "word": "ימר", "translit": "ya.mar", "root": "ימם", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "to exchange", "definition": "ימר verb assumed in Thes to explain Hiph`il הֵימִיר = הֵמִיר Jer 2:11 , and Hithpa`el תִּתְיַמָּ֑רוּ Isa 61:6 but on הימיר see מור ( Kö i. 457 ), and תִּתְיַמָּ֑רוּ is probably from אמר q. v. above. יִמְרָה see below מרה .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3582')\">BDB3582</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3235')\">H3235</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3581')\">BDB3581</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3583')\">BDB3583</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>ימר</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> assumed in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> to explain <b>Hiph`il</b> <bdbheb>הֵימִיר</bdbheb> = <bdbheb>הֵמִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 2:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,2,11)\">Jer 2:11</ref>, and <b>Hithpa`el</b> <bdbheb>תִּתְיַמָּ֑רוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 61:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"61\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"61\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,61,6)\">Isa 61:6</ref> but on <bdbheb>הימיר</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>מור</reflink></bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>i. 457</sup></lookup>), and <bdbheb>תִּתְיַמָּ֑רוּ</bdbheb> is probably from  <bdbheb><reflink>אמר</reflink></bdbheb> q. v. above. </p><hr><p><bdbheb>יִמְרָה</bdbheb> see below <bdbheb>מרה</bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Jer 2:11", "book": "JER", "chapter": 2, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Isa 61:6", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 61, "verse": 6}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["ימר", "הֵימִיר", "הֵמִיר", "תִּתְיַמָּ֑רוּ", "הימיר", "מור", "אמר", "יִמְרָה", "מרה"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Kö", "Thes"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB3582", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}